<title>USA: Ariel hires advisor for strategic partners.</title>
<headline>Ariel hires advisor for strategic partners.</headline>
<dateline>CRANBURY, N.J. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ariel Corp said Thursday that it has retained Needham &amp; Co as an advisor to identify potential strategic partners for its Asymmetrical Digital Subscriber Line technology.</p>
<p>Ariel said Needham will help to identify prospective partners, including possible acquisition candidates and solicit indications of interest.</p>
